From 86a6600484cf3d065eb7737aaab14283198bb66c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:18:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat(keys): add reopen shortcut for keys overlay V1.45
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New rebindable action keysOverlay, default KeyH: pressing it while
driving reopens the keys overlay after Esc closed it. The overlay
rows (driving + pause-menu list) show 按键显示 with the bound key,
and the hidden-state restore button shows the same key + 显示 in
the same form as Esc 关闭. Old saves get the default via parseKeys
merge, so no storage-key change.
